        "kind": "battlefield",
        "seed": 505,
        "palette": "gold",
        "density": 22
      },
      "lines": [
        "妖族称臣，精灵纳贡，魔族低头。",
        "人族自此，再无外敌。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "seconds": 7.0,
      "backdrop": {
        "kind": "battlefield",
        "seed": 606,
        "palette": "dusk",
        "density": 26
      },
      "lines": [
        "他行军千里，所向披靡。",
        "没有人见过他败。"
      ]
    },
